[62.155214, "o", "4. **Signal Strength $\\mu$**: \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[62.15525, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[62.155612, "o", "   - The best-fit $\\hat{\\mu}$ is the value that maximizes the likelihood (minimizes $-2\\log L(\\mu)$).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[62.155663, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
